      ]
    },
    {
      "t": 51.0,
      "say": "That comes back async, Stripe calls us."
    },
    {
      "t": 54.5,
      "say": "And I think the webhook is what actually marks the order refunded, not the API response, but I'm maybe seventy percent on that."
    },
